Gills of Flesh transforms the target's respiratory system to breathe
water as easily as air. The spell creates temporary gill-like structures
that extract oxygen from water, allowing extended underwater exploration.

Usage: cast 'gills of flesh' <target>

The spell grants the water breathing ability for up to 8 hours, more than
enough time for most underwater expeditions. The target can breathe both
air and water while the spell is active.

This spell is essential for exploring underwater areas, recovering items
from bodies of water, or pursuing aquatic enemies into their domain.
Without it, land-dwellers quickly drown in underwater environments.

Class: Mage
Discipline: Water

See Also: AQUALUNG, SWIM
